OL,3,GNEWSA'I meant to buy one, then the
OL,4,Acollecting bug bit'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recent sale of 1990s wrestling
OL,7,Ffigures saw many selling for hundreds
OL,8,Fof pounds. Why do these toys still grip
OL,9,Fcollectors?
OL,11,FBret Hitman Hart has not wrestled for
OL,12,Fyears, but the Canadian superstar's
OL,13,Fpopularity among fans remains undimmed.
OL,15,FSo much so a 34-year-old figure of him
OL,16,Ffetched more than #1,000 when it went
OL,17,Funder the hammer at Vectis Auctions in
OL,18,FThornaby, Stockton, on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
