OL,5,
OL,6,FThe toy, still in its original
OL,7,Fpackaging, was originally released in
OL,8,F1992 in the fourth series of WWF (later
OL,9,Frebranded WWE) toys made by Hasbro, who
OL,10,Freleased about 100 figures between 1990
OL,11,Fand 1994.
